Package: rCoros
Title: Access COROS Training Hub Fitness Data in R
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-06-07
Authors@R:
    person(
        given   = "Matt",
        family  = "O'Reilly",
        email   = "fermoymatt@gmail.com",
        role    = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description:
    Provides a tidy interface to the COROS Training Hub API.
    Retrieve activities, daily wellness metrics (HRV, resting heart rate,
    VO2max, training load), workout programmes, and training calendars.
    All results are returned as tibbles ready for analysis with dplyr
    and ggplot2.  Supports both US and EU regional endpoints.
